			"notes": "ADDED\n- Each turret model is now its own turret: Modern, Industrial, Scrap and Tactical, each with its own stats and recipe.\n- Added the Turret Workbench. Turrets and camos are crafted there instead of at a crafting table.\n- Added the Brass Turret for Create. It needs rotational power from a small cogwheel placed next to it, fires slower at low rotation speeds and reaches its full fire rate at 64 RPM.\n- Added the Steel Turret for Immersive Engineering.\n- Added the Basic, Advanced, Elite and Ultimate Turrets for Mekanism. Each tier is crafted from the tier below it.\n- Mod addon turrets only appear when their mod is installed.\n- Added Sentry Turrets. They spawn in structures, on the surface or in caves, and roll a random turret type, gun, laser, paint and ammo.\n- Added sentry turret loadouts and spawn rules. These are datapack files.\n- Sentry turrets can spawn with a camo that fits their biome, and drop a few of their turret's crafting materials when destroyed.\n- Mod addon turrets don't spawn as sentry turrets by default.\n- Added the Sentry Turret Spawn Egg.\n- Turrets can now use TACZ laser attachments.\n- Crouching and right-clicking a turret with a dye or banner paints it. Axes scrape paint and camos off, and turrets keep their paint or camo when picked up.\n- Added 19 camos, crafted in the Camos tab of the Turret Workbench.\n- Added the TACZ Turrets creative tab.\n- Turrets now lock on to a target with a sound for a second before firing, and make a sound when they look around.\n- Added reload speed and fire rate stats. Fire rate stats are off by default.\n- Added new death messages.\n- Added Villager Recruits ally support.\n- Added Spanish, Mexican Spanish, Canadian French, European Portuguese, German, Dutch, Czech, Ukrainian, Turkish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Vietnamese and Indonesian translations.\n- Added many configs, including identicalTurrets, an enabled option for each turret, dropItemsOnDeath, pickupItemsToInventory, pickupTurretToInventory, returnCamos, moddedSentryTurrets and the laserWithoutGun client config.\n- Added Sxilverr to the author list. (Hey that's me! :D)\n\nCHANGED\n- Removed the Retro and Sci-Fi turret models, and the modelType client config.\n- Old turrets turn into Modern Turrets in existing worlds.\n- Turret stats like health, armor, range and energy are now set for each turret in its own config section.\n- The requireEnergy config is now requirePower, set for each turret. Mod addon turrets need power by default.\n- Turrets now take damage from explosions and lava by default, but are still immune to fire.\n- Turrets no longer target invisible mobs and players by default.\n- Turrets now attack neutral mobs when they are angry.\n- Improved the Scrap Turret's texture.\n\nFIXED\n- Fixed ceiling turrets pulling power and ammo from the block below instead of the block they hang from.\n- Fixed Jade showing an energy bar on turrets that don't need power."
		},
